    "title": "Real Car Driving Drifting Game",
    "description": "Get ready for real car driving drifting game experience every turn is a challenge, and every drift is a thrill for the lovers of real car driving racing city, you\u2019ll experience the thrill of real car drifting and you will explore a huge open world car driving environment of ultimate car driving game. Car drift games offers you a character and different breeds of dogs for traffic driving car games 3d. You can choose your favourite one at real car drifting and driving games. Start your journey at school car driving and drifting game. The open world car driving starting point of extreme car drifting, you\u2019ll find 4-5 different cars waiting for you in real car drifting and driving games, Pick up your favourite car in extreme car driving games and choose your favourite dog or cat from the various dog and cat breeds that are placed in front of your in school car driving and drifting games.\r\n\r\nReal car driving racing city has two different environments in open world car driving mode: the lovely city for ultimate car driving and the offroad environment for extreme car driving games lovers. Enhance your real car drifting and driving games skills, master yourself in school car driving and drifting games, and enjoy the traffic driving car games 3d. While ultimate car driving you\u2019ll have cool features at your fingertips in traffic driving car games 3d. Use the Car Jump button to leap over traffic and obstacles in extreme car driving games. Hit the NOS button to give your luxury car a burst of speed in real car driving racing city when you need it in picking up high speed checkpoints for missions of ultimate car driving games. Plus, you can refuel your car when its about to end in real car driving games and also repair your car anywhere before it gets damaged in real car driving and drifting games. Also stay connected with the mobile phone function in traffic driving car games 3d, which lets you call any car, dog, or cat to your location. Need a new ride or want to drive new car? At extreme car drifting Just make a call!. Real car drifting game offers a wide range of missions and challenges for real car driving and drifting games players.\r\n\r\nMega Ramp Jump:\r\nIn ultimate car driving speed up and launch off the ramp to soar through the air. It\u2019s all about timing and control to land safely on the other side of the road in extreme car driving games. Show off your extreme car drifting skills and make the most spectacular jump in car drift games!\r\n\r\nSpeed Checkpoints:\r\nIn traffic driving car games 3d race through the city or in the offroad environment while aiming for picking up high speed checkpoints in extreme car driving games. Each checkpoint has a speed you need to reach in car drift games. Zoom past these points as fast as you can to hit the required speed in car driving school simulator. It\u2019s a test of how quickly and skilfully you can drive in school car driving and drifting games!\r\n\r\nParking:\r\nIn school car driving show off your parking skills in car drift games. Complete challenging parking missions of extreme car drifting game. Navigate your school car driving into tight and tricky parking spots without bumping into obstacles. It\u2019s a fun test of precision and control as you park your car perfectly in the designated area of extreme car drifting.\r\n\r\n\r\nReal Car Driving Drifting Game Feature: \r\n\r\nMultiple luxury cars\r\nDifferent breeds of dogs and cats\r\nMobile function (call anything in environment)\r\nCar jump button (to jump over obstacles\r\nDifferent missions In car drift games\r\nCar drift button (to start drifting in car)\r\nCar refuel and car repair",
